{"id":1030204,"chapter_id":1030204,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"speaker":"行动人员","content":"局长，潜入小队失败了。出现了四名伤员，均需要进行对狂厄的紧急治疗……","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_1"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"行动人员朝你汇报着情况。另一边，到场支援的执委会负责人正不住抱怨着。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"speaker":"执委会","content":"太扯淡了，都什么时候了，怎么会有这么多狂厄结晶和狂厄武器的？！就算是BR-004之前也没见过这种阵仗……","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_2"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"speaker":"执委会","content":"干脆直接强攻吧，我不想再跟这些人渣继续耗下去了！","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"这太冒险了。","style":2,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"流浪儿们还在里面，强攻几乎意味着他们会立刻丧命。","style":2,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"speaker":"执委会","content":"那有什么要紧的，一群小**罢了，有辛迪加的安全重要吗？","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"content":"你看向一边的科希。她没有对执委会的话做出任何反应，此刻出奇的安静。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"content":"不行，我不同意。","style":2,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"speaker":"执委会","content":"那你说怎么办？你的潜入小队已经玩儿完了，你还能有什么办法？","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"你转过头，看向身边的科希。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"content":"我可以相信你，对吧？","style":2,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"content":"如果你都做不到的话，就没人可以做到了。","style":2,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"content":"科希依旧没有说话。缄默而又狂暴阴影缠绕上她的身体，裹挟着她径直走向面前的建筑。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"content":"那就是她的回答。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"content":"待到科希的身影消失，身旁执委会负责人的声音才有些不合时宜地响起。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"speaker":"执委会","content":"就她一个人，你确定不是在派你的禁闭者去送死？","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"content":"她可以的……","style":2,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"content":"流浪儿一直都很信任她，她从来没有辜负过这份信任。","style":2,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"speaker":"万灵会成员","content":"*，这个管理局怎么**的阴魂不散。","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"speaker":"万灵会成员","content":"好在我们把他们打回去了。可惜折了九个兄弟……","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"speaker":"万灵会成员","content":"别高兴得太早，那才几个人，下一步他们得强攻了。","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"speaker":"万灵会成员","content":"拼了，我们把剩下的狂厄结晶都用了吧！","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"content":"面对嘈杂的人群，为首的女人敲了敲桌子。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"speaker":"万灵会头领","content":"安静。","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"content":"这位黑袍的大祭司默默起身，缓缓走向房间角落那群瑟瑟发抖的孩子们。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"speaker":"万灵会头领","content":"这不是还有能用的炮灰嘛。","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"content":"万灵会的成员们一下子就明白了头领的意思，狞笑着向流浪儿们走去。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"speaker":"万灵会头领","content":"偷了我们的狂厄结晶，也该付点利息了。","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"content":"噗——","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"content":"一道不知从何出现的、尖锐的影子轻轻贯穿了黑袍女人的胸腔。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"content":"这个曾在最残酷的帮派战争中幸存下来的女人没能作出任何抵抗，悄无声息地倒在了地上。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"speaker":"万灵会成员","content":"！！！","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"content":"万灵会的人反应极为迅速，也没有因为头领的倒下而有任何犹豫。盲目的信仰和狂厄结晶的影响早已摧毁了他们的理智。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"content":"他们的脑海里只剩下疯狂，头领的死反而切断了最后一丝理智。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"speaker":"万灵会成员","content":"怪……怪物！！！","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"content":"他们说的或许没错，怪物，那个正被蠕动的黑暗所缠绕的身影，正如自黑暗中降临的怪物一般。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"content":"一切攻击都毫无效果：携带着狂厄的子弹、刀剑都仿佛投入湖中的石子，被那庞大的黑暗吞噬。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"content":"作为回报，黑暗伸出了她狂暴的触须，带着浓厚不详的尖刺自地面涌出。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"content":"穿刺、撕裂、吞噬……这些使用了狂厄结晶的、旁人眼中的怪物，可悲地成为了另一个怪物的猎物。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"content":"这是一场由恶意、愤怒、痛苦交织而成的混沌。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"options":["营救被困的流浪儿"],"style":6,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204042,"trial_step":42,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"营救被困的流浪儿","goto":43}]},{"step":43,"content":"当你带着人冲进屋内时，一切都已经结束了。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"speaker":"行动人员","content":"确认人质安全。","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"content":"行动人员的手电照向墙角。在这间阴暗房间内几天没有见过阳光的孩子们似乎有些畏光，颤抖着遮住了自己的脸。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"content":"他们的表情茫然又痛苦，难以想象这几天里他们经历了什么。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"content":"另一边，科希站在屋子的正中央，那些狂暴的黑暗已经悉数被收敛回身体。此刻的她，看起来与普通的孩子无异。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"content":"做得很好……科希。","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"content":"科希没有应声。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"content":"黑暗吞没了这里曾发生过的一切，也吞没了科希小小的脸庞。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"speaker":"行动人员","content":"局长，刚刚的战斗破坏了建筑的结构，这里现在很危险……请尽快赶紧撤离！","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"content":"在你们全员撤出公寓后不久，这栋老旧的建筑就再无法支撑自身的重量，终于坍塌为一地碎石瓦砾。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"content":"行动已经持续了了两个小时，本身附近也是居民区，有些原本住在这里的居民早已在这里围观。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204053,"trial_step":53},{"step":54,"speaker":"路人","content":"我家……我家没了！究竟发生了什么啊……","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"speaker":"路人","content":"都怪流浪儿那群小**，是他们把万灵会和当差的都引过来的。","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"content":"一个女人高声向你这边叫嚣着，捡起地上的碎石就扔了过来。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204056,"trial_step":56},{"step":57,"speaker":"路人","content":"全都是你们的错！","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"content":"初春的气温尚未回暖，被救出来的孩子们很多身上只有一件破破烂烂的单衣。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204058,"trial_step":58},{"step":59,"content":"满目疮痍之下，他们在寒风与恶语中瑟瑟发抖。你看见当初那个曾经给你和科希带过路的男孩缩了缩脖子，仿佛被吓破了胆的小兔子一样，不敢应声。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"speaker":"路人","content":"当差的，好好关住这些小**，别让他们再出来了！","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"speaker":"路人","content":"关什么关！关了有什么用？！","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204061,"trial_step":61},{"step":62,"speaker":"路人","content":"把我家还给我！","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"speaker":"流浪儿","content":"呜哇——","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"content":"最年幼的孩子在成年人的围观下终于再难忍受，哇地一声哭了出来。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204064,"trial_step":64},{"step":65,"content":"其余的孩子也被这情绪所传染，个个眼里挂着泪水。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"speaker":"路人","content":"哟，现在知道哭啦？小**以前不是挺威风的吗。","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204066,"trial_step":66},{"step":67,"content":"你有些于心不忍，吩咐行动人员驱散旁观的人群。但就在同时，执委会的负责人来到了你身前。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"speaker":"执委会","content":"哦？还真被一网打尽了，做得不错啊MBCC的局长，你的禁闭者的确很厉害。","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"content":"我只是尽可能履行职责罢了。","style":2,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204069,"trial_step":69},{"step":70,"speaker":"执委会","content":"嗯，有你这样靠谱的友方部分协助真是太好了。","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204070,"trial_step":70},{"step":71,"content":"这些孩子你们打算怎么安置？","style":2,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204071,"trial_step":71},{"step":72,"content":"辛迪加如今是执委会的辖区，按制度来讲只能由他们处理事件后续。但你不太放心，还是多问了一嘴。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204072,"trial_step":72},{"step":73,"speaker":"执委会","content":"这些小鬼？不用管他们，待会儿就放了吧。","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204073,"trial_step":73},{"step":74,"content":"放了？！","style":2,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204074,"trial_step":74},{"step":75,"speaker":"执委会","content":"怎么了？活着的这些又没染上狂厄，也不用你多管吧。","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204075,"trial_step":75},{"step":76,"content":"你自己看看他们的精神状况……更何况万灵会可能还没有清缴干净，就不怕他们被报复吗？","style":2,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204076,"trial_step":76},{"step":77,"content":"这位执委会负责人有些好笑地上下打量了你一眼。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204077,"trial_step":77},{"step":78,"speaker":"执委会","content":"早就听说MBCC的局长是个大善人，今天一见还真是这样。","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204078,"trial_step":78},{"step":79,"speaker":"执委会","content":"省省吧，局长大人，辛迪加这样的事情还少吗？管不过来的。","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204079,"trial_step":79},{"step":80,"content":"可是他们真的非常需要帮助。","style":2,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204080,"trial_step":80},{"step":81,"speaker":"执委会","content":"你要管你自己管吧，执委会可不是做慈善的。","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204081,"trial_step":81},{"step":82,"speaker":"执委会","content":"再说了，真要让这群臭小鬼活过这一劫，过几年就是新的万灵会，新的黑帮……所以才说辛迪加没有未来啊。","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204082,"trial_step":82},{"step":83,"content":"你察觉到身后的科希情绪不太对劲，想要阻止执委会的人继续说下去。可那家伙却毫无眼力，继续滔滔不绝地对你讲着：","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204083,"trial_step":83},{"step":84,"speaker":"执委会","content":"算了，也不打紧。过几年等他们成年了自然会落到我们手上，到时候上面的伦理委员会就不会管我们了……","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204084,"trial_step":84},{"step":85,"content":"似乎是想起了什么，执委会负责人突然说道：","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204085,"trial_step":85},{"step":86,"speaker":"执委会","content":"啊对了，这次的案子还是得结的，我记得这次的主谋，是个粉毛小鬼，对吧？","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204086,"trial_step":86},{"step":87,"content":"他看向管理局的队伍，在人群中找到了桑蒂。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204087,"trial_step":87},{"step":88,"content":"此刻的桑蒂精神状况和被绑架的流浪儿差不了多少，这几天发生的一系列事件早已让她的心理防线崩溃。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204088,"trial_step":88},{"step":89,"speaker":"执委会","content":"你考虑得还真是周到啊，把人也替我们带来了。","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204089,"trial_step":89},{"step":90,"content":"执委会走向你的队伍，一把揪住了桑蒂的头发。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204090,"trial_step":90},{"step":91,"speaker":"执委会","content":"这种臭小鬼可不能轻饶，否则辛迪加的治安就全毁了……","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204091,"trial_step":91},{"step":92,"content":"桑蒂尖叫着摔倒在地，被拽着头发拖行。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204092,"trial_step":92},{"step":93,"speaker":"桑蒂","content":"科希！救救我……","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204093,"trial_step":93},{"step":94,"content":"你立即上前阻止执委会负责人那粗暴的行径，但还是晚了一步。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204094,"trial_step":94},{"step":95,"speaker":"执委会","content":"啊！！","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_39"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204095,"trial_step":95},{"step":96,"content":"一声惨叫打断了你们的“对话”。你这才注意到，阴影已然自你身前漫过，狠狠扎穿他的脚面。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204096,"trial_step":96},{"step":97,"content":"科希出手了。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204097,"trial_step":97},{"step":98,"speaker":"选择","options":["阻止科希"],"style":6,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204098,"trial_step":98,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"阻止科希","goto":99}]},{"step":99,"content":"你立即转过身，冲着科希大声呼喊。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204099,"trial_step":99},{"step":100,"content":"科希，冷静！","style":2,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204100,"trial_step":100},{"step":101,"content":"科希淡淡地看了你一眼，接着视线重新移回执委会的人身上。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204101,"trial_step":101},{"step":102,"content":"数不清的影子缠住了他们。你赶紧冲向科希，抓住了她的手。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204102,"trial_step":102},{"step":103,"content":"不要意气用事！他们说什么不重要，重要的是你，还有流浪儿……你们还有未来……","style":2,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204103,"trial_step":103},{"step":104,"speaker":"科希","content":"滚开！！！","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204104,"trial_step":104},{"step":105,"content":"科希狠狠挣开你的手。你被一股巨大的力量甩向一边，跌倒在地上。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204105,"trial_step":105},{"step":106,"speaker":"科希","content":"流浪儿不需要你给的未来！","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204106,"trial_step":106},{"step":107,"content":"科希吼叫着，巨大的阴影遮盖了地面和天空。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204107,"trial_step":107},{"step":108,"content":"你不能眼睁睁看着科希铸成大错。你只剩下了一个选择。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204108,"trial_step":108},{"step":109,"content":"最终，经过上级机构的协调，流浪儿们还是被执委会带走了。但仅两天后他们就被释放。在随后的两个月中，他们仿佛销声匿迹一般，极少有目击情报。\n桑蒂作为事件的主犯，受到了执委会的长期收容。\n科希在事件结束后一直拒绝与任何人沟通。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204111,"trial_step":111},{"step":110,"options":["科希……"],"style":6,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204112,"trial_step":112,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"科希……","goto":113}]},{"step":111,"content":"禁闭室中的气氛沉默得有些可怕。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204113,"trial_step":113},{"step":112,"content":"自狂厄结晶事件结束已经过去了三个月。这三个月来，你没有和科希有过哪怕一次正常的对话。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204114,"trial_step":114},{"step":113,"content":"她几次尝试逃跑，但都被你阻拦下来。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204115,"trial_step":115},{"step":114,"content":"多少次你想跟她谈谈，却不知从何说起。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204116,"trial_step":116},{"step":115,"content":"但这一次，科希居然主动开口了。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204117,"trial_step":117},{"step":116,"speaker":"科希","content":"桑蒂怎么样了？","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_42"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204118,"trial_step":118},{"step":117,"content":"她实际年龄已经超过十六岁了……","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204119,"trial_step":119},{"step":118,"content":"执行官坚持她是这次狂厄结晶事件的主谋。还有一个月，她会在西区临时法庭接受审判。","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204120,"trial_step":120},{"step":119,"speaker":"科希","content":"呵呵……呵呵呵呵……抓典型是吧……显摆业绩是吧……","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204121,"trial_step":121},{"step":120,"speaker":"科希","content":"狂厄结晶肆虐了那么多年，那群废物们敢对付黑帮吗？现在黑帮没了，倒是能对着一个连汤都没喝上的小屁孩出重拳了是吗？！","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_44"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204122,"trial_step":122},{"step":121,"content":"我会为她争取的。","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204123,"trial_step":123},{"step":122,"speaker":"科希","content":"争取什么？让她无罪释放，然后呢？那么多流浪儿还在辛迪加那个鬼地方，他们活不下去，明天还会去偷，去抢，再被抓起来。","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204124,"trial_step":124},{"step":123,"speaker":"科希","content":"你每次都去争取？","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204125,"trial_step":125},{"step":124,"speaker":"科希","content":"局长大人这么有毅力吗？","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_47"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204126,"trial_step":126},{"step":125,"content":"辛迪加的环境……的确不适合他们成长，我打算寻找合适的机构收养他们。","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204127,"trial_step":127},{"step":126,"speaker":"科希","content":"你自己都不信吧？","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204128,"trial_step":128},{"step":127,"content":"现在的辛迪加……或许的确不行。","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204129,"trial_step":129},{"step":128,"content":"但我，还有其他很多人，我们还在努力，去重新建立秩序，建立人与人之间的信任……","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204130,"trial_step":130},{"step":129,"content":"总有一天……","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204131,"trial_step":131},{"step":130,"speaker":"科希","content":"太晚了！","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204132,"trial_step":132},{"step":131,"speaker":"科希","content":"我知道的，我都知道……就算把她放出来，桑蒂也不会改的，她早就习惯了，她连我都骗，以后也回不来了。","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204133,"trial_step":133},{"step":132,"speaker":"科希","content":"可谁有那个本事在辛迪加这臭水沟里活得干净漂亮？那些大人做得到吗？！","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204134,"trial_step":134},{"step":133,"options":["科希，不是的……"],"style":6,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204135,"trial_step":135,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"科希，不是的……","goto":136}]},{"step":134,"speaker":"科希","content":"怎么不是？局长大人，你是好人，大好人。你看谁都想拉一把。","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204136,"trial_step":136},{"step":135,"speaker":"科希","content":"可伸手的人那么多，你救得完吗？","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204137,"trial_step":137},{"step":136,"options":["不管能不能，都要这么做……"],"style":6,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204138,"trial_step":138,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"不管能不能，都要这么做……","goto":139}]},{"step":137,"content":"科希，你们面对的不是孩子该承受的东西。你们还小，让大人去解决吧，大人有力量，也有责任保护孩子。我们会保护你们的。","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204139,"trial_step":139},{"step":138,"content":"你想抓住她的手。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204140,"trial_step":140},{"step":139,"speaker":"科希","content":"别碰我！","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_54"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204141,"trial_step":141},{"step":140,"content":"她几乎条件反射般挥开了。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204142,"trial_step":142},{"step":141,"speaker":"科希","content":"“成年人”……哈哈……保护孩子的“成年人”……哈哈……也只有你会这么想……","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_55"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204143,"trial_step":143},{"step":142,"speaker":"科希","content":"他们有了力量，为什么不自己用？这可是辛迪加，毛都没长齐的弱小鬼只配任人宰割，我们凭什么得到别人的保护？","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204144,"trial_step":144},{"step":143,"speaker":"科希","content":"把那些仁义道德收起来吧，没有力量的流浪儿就是食物链的最底端，想活下去只有一条路。","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204145,"trial_step":145},{"step":144,"speaker":"科希","content":"——不择手段地变强，不择手段地“长大”，变成“成年人”，变成下一批混蛋，制造下一批流浪儿，明白了吗？","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204146,"trial_step":146},{"step":145,"speaker":"科希","content":"生在辛迪加，我们都一样！怎么样？还想救谁吗？！","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_59"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204147,"trial_step":147},{"step":146,"content":"她双眼干得发红，嘶哑的声音中却听出了恸哭般的情感，紧紧扼住你的心脏。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204148,"trial_step":148},{"step":147,"options":["不，你不一样……"],"style":6,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204149,"trial_step":149,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"不，你不一样……","goto":150}]},{"step":148,"content":"这么长的时间里，只有你在保护那些孩子们，用一个孩子的力量保护他们。即使在辛迪加那样的地方，你也活得很漂亮。","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204150,"trial_step":150},{"step":149,"content":"但那不是该让你一个孩子承担的责任。我会帮你的，我们去创造一个你想要的未来。","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204151,"trial_step":151},{"step":150,"content":"你再次抓住了她的手，她拼命挣扎，想要甩开，这次你牢牢握住。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204152,"trial_step":152},{"step":151,"content":"终于，她放弃了，累了。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204153,"trial_step":153},{"step":152,"speaker":"科希","content":"哈哈……我在干什么……居然对你发脾气……","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204154,"trial_step":154},{"step":153,"speaker":"科希","content":"局长大人……不……${PlayerName}……对不起……你是个好人……真正的好人……","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204155,"trial_step":155},{"step":154,"speaker":"科希","content":"别为我的事感到抱歉……也不用……可怜我……","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_62"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204156,"trial_step":156},{"step":155,"speaker":"科希","content":"能被关进这里的“科希”，已经很幸运了……","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_63"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204157,"trial_step":157},{"step":156,"speaker":"科希","content":"太幸运了……变成了禁闭者，还能……遇见你……","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_64"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204158,"trial_step":158},{"step":157,"speaker":"科希","content":"可是，${PlayerName}……世界……那么大……黑夜……那么长……","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_65"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204159,"trial_step":159},{"step":158,"speaker":"科希","content":"不是所有人都有这个运气……","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_66"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204160,"trial_step":160},{"step":159,"content":"她不再看你，靠着墙的身体渐渐脱力下滑。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204161,"trial_step":161},{"step":160,"speaker":"科希","content":"更多流浪儿没变成禁闭者……她们要么一起堕落，要么一起死亡……","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_68"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204162,"trial_step":162},{"step":161,"speaker":"科希","content":"更多禁闭者遇不到你……被撕扯，被折磨，直到变成怪物，才算解脱……","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_69"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204163,"trial_step":163},{"step":162,"speaker":"科希","content":"今天，你，我，在这里……是奇迹，本不会发生的奇迹……","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_70"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204164,"trial_step":164},{"step":163,"speaker":"科希","content":"更多的“科希”没这个运气……她们连对你发脾气的机会都没有……","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_71"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204165,"trial_step":165},{"step":164,"speaker":"科希","content":"那才是“大多数”……${PlayerName}，那才是真实……在这样的世界……我没有想要的未来……","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_72"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204166,"trial_step":166},{"step":165,"content":"你张嘴，却说不出话，只能紧紧攥住她的手，就算那只瘦小的手已经放弃挣扎。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204167,"trial_step":167},{"step":166,"options":["至少，这里的我已经握住你的手了"],"style":6,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204168,"trial_step":168,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"至少，这里的我已经握住你的手了","goto":169}]},{"step":167,"content":"相信自己吧，科希……你说自己幸运地遇到我了，那一定也能……幸运地找到改变未来的道路……","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204169,"trial_step":169},{"step":168,"content":"我保证不了什么……除了……不会放开你的手，不会再让你一个人面对……","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204170,"trial_step":170},{"step":169,"content":"科希倚在阴影中，眼泪无声滑落，许久才接了话。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204171,"trial_step":171},{"step":170,"speaker":"科希","content":"是吗……那我真是……","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_74"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204172,"trial_step":172},{"step":171,"speaker":"科希","content":"太幸运了……","voice":["vo_trial_30204_1_75"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204173,"trial_step":173},{"step":172,"content":"她再也没看你的眼睛。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130204174,"trial_step":174}]}